# Optional local development settings. Copy to `.env` if you need them.
#
# This file documents development tooling ONLY. It must never contain a real
# credential, and no debug or release build may require a developer-owned AI key
# to run — the app has to build and work for a contributor who has none.
#
# `.env` itself is gitignored, and CI refuses to merge a commit that tracks a
# file with a credential-shaped name.

# Base URL of a local fake AI provider, for developing the Phase 2 coach without
# calling a paid API. Anything speaking the OpenAI-compatible chat-completions
# shape works. Leave unset to use the app's built-in rules-only generation.
# REPFORTH_FAKE_PROVIDER_URL=http://localhost:8088/v1

# Seed for deterministic plan generation while debugging the rules engine.
# Unset means a random seed, which is the real behaviour.
# REPFORTH_GENERATION_SEED=
